IncreaseDurationIntegrationConcreteTest
├── When caller is not owner
│   └── It should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount}
└── When caller is owner
    ├── When the duration is zero
    │   └── It should revert with {ZeroDuration}
    └── When the duration is not zero
        ├── When the locker is unlocked
        │   └── It should revert with {NotLocked}
        └── When the locker is locked
            ├── When the locker is permanently locked
            │   └── It should revert with {PermanentLock}
            └── When the locker is not permanently locked
                ├── When the duration is UINT32_MAX
                │   ├── It should permanently lock the liquidity
                │   └── It should emit an {UnlockTimestampIncreased} event
                └── When the duration is not UINT32_MAX
                    ├── It should increase the unlock timestamp
                    └── It should emit an {UnlockTimestampIncreased} event
